msgstr ""
"The Sector 3 campaign features a brand-new operation with a powerful main reward: the Tier X Fossa VM 68, a sniper medium tank with an accurate gun and exceptional mobility. \n"
"\n"
"You can start the new operation at any time, regardless of your current progress in the Sector 3 campaign."

